        "collapsible_tab_ERGKLJ": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What to expect?",
            "heading_size": "small",
            "icon": "dentistry",
            "filled_icon": true,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>Daily use gently removes wax, dirt, and buildup before they can contribute to ear problems. Here's what you'll typically notice in your pet:</p><p><strong>Week 1</strong> — ears look cleaner, with less visible wax and debris after each wipe.<br/><br/><strong>Week 2</strong> — less buildup returns between cleanings, and ears stay fresher for longer.<br/><br/><strong>Week 3 </strong>— consistently clean ears with reduced wax buildup and a healthier ear environment.<br/><br/>Every wipe comes away with the wax, dirt, and debris you've just removed — visible proof it's lifting buildup from the ear, not simply pushing it around.</p>",
            "page": "free-e-book-the-secret-to-a-sparkling-home-in-just-15-minutes-a-day",
            "margin_top": 12,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_3z9NFe": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why RoutineCare?",
            "heading_size": "small",
            "icon": "loyalty",
            "filled_icon": true,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>✓ Save 20% on every order</p><p>✓ Free shipping, always</p><p>✓ Free gifts — plus surprise treats in your boxes</p><p>✓ Delivered every 30 days — skip, reschedule or change frequency anytime</p><p>✓ Skip, pause or cancel anytime — you're always in control</p><p>✓ Your refill arrives before you run out</p><p>✓ Consistency is what makes results last</p><p>✓ 100-day money-back guarantee — or you don't pay</p>",
            "page": "free-e-book-the-secret-to-a-sparkling-home-in-just-15-minutes-a-day",
            "margin_top": 12,
