            "display_arrows": false,
            "display_dots": true,
            "author_1": "Anna Müller, Germany [stars]",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/Profilbild_21_6774d488-3bc3-405d-b134-5d5f0598af50.webp",
            "text_1": "<p>ClearSwipe has transformed my cleaning routine. With just one swipe, my windows are spotless and streak-free. It's incredibly easy to use and saves me so much time.</p>",
            "author_2": "Luca Rossi, Italy [stars]",
            "image_2": "shopify://shop_images/Profilbild_32.webp",
            "text_2": "<p>I was skeptical at first, but ClearSwipe exceeded my expectations. It's durable, eco-friendly, and leaves my mirrors and glass surfaces gleaming. Highly recommended!</p>",
            "author_3": "Sophie Dubois, France [stars]",
            "image_3": "shopify://shop_images/Profilbild111.webp",
            "text_3": "<p>I've tried various window cleaners, but ClearSwipe stands out. It cleans efficiently without leaving any streaks or drips. Plus, it's made from recycled materials, which I appreciate.</p>",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 24
          }
