          "settings": {
            "title": "Gentle care for <strong>sensitive ears</strong>",
            "title_highlight_color": "#47b5e9",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_JVGtNh": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>EarWipes are developed with your dog's sensitive ears in focus.</p><p>The formula is free from harsh chemicals and developed to be safe to use regularly.</p><p>Each wipe is pH-balanced and gentle, while effectively removing wax, dirt and bacteria.</p><p><strong>Naturally caring ingredients:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Corn extract</strong> – mild & natural cleaning that keeps ears fresh.</li><li><strong>Rosemary extract</strong> – cleansing & antibacterial power from nature.</li><li><strong>Witch hazel</strong> – soothes irritation and reduces itching.</li></ul><p>Together they provide a cleaning that both prevents and cares – so your dog avoids discomfort and you don't have to worry about infections.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
